From b11935239f6d39e868d3bc4d32fa74d511826925 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: newjordan <newjordan@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 19:59:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] sycl: reorder-on-MoE for Q4_K and Q5_K mul_mat_id

Extend the weight-reorder opt to the fused MoE expert GEMV (mul_mat_id), with reorder-aware reads across all decode and prefill sub-paths (adds a Q5_K reorder DMMV kernel and per-expert reorder converters). Decode +16.3% Q4_K_M / +17.7% Q5_K_M on Arc B70; verified vs CPU ref (test-backend-ops MUL_MAT_ID) and a server prefill-after-reorder differential.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 4.8
